    "For deterministic offline cache-hit routing, provision and independently verify both logical cache binaries and exact no-newline checksum sidecars in the actually resolved accessible cache. Detect and reject absent, unreadable, mismatched, symlinked or stale artifacts instead of skipping integrity.",
    "No PRISMA_ENGINES_CHECKSUM_IGNORE_MISSING, skipCacheIntegrityCheck, custom engine override, mirror override, version override, no-engine switch, ambient credential/proxy expansion or TLS bypass.",
    "Before any successor case slot, an accepted bounded nonjourney readiness harness must prove Prisma generation/native prerequisites and real Chromium executable/system-library readiness in the same isolated child and exact sanitized environment; source, dependency, environment and cleanup evidence must be bound and independently reviewed.",
    "That readiness harness may not start the product application, touch a database, navigate product journeys, capture media, reserve product/case custody, or reinterpret setup evidence as product qualification. Actual runtime proof has not been performed by this reviewer."
